flowchart LR

    USER[User]

    UI[Streamlit Web UI]

    API[FastAPI Backend]

    RATE[Rate Limiting]

    CACHE[Response Cache]

    RETRY[Retry Mechanism]

    OLLAMA[Ollama Server]

    MODEL[Qwen 2.5 1.5B]

    FALLBACK[Groq Fallback Provider]

    ERROR[Error Handling<br/>Graceful Degradation]

    RESPONSE[JSON Response]


    USER --> UI

    UI --> API

    API --> RATE

    RATE --> CACHE

    CACHE --> RETRY

    RETRY --> OLLAMA

    OLLAMA --> MODEL

    MODEL --> RESPONSE

    OLLAMA -. Service Failure .-> FALLBACK

    FALLBACK --> RESPONSE

    RETRY -. Retry Failed .-> ERROR

    FALLBACK -. Fallback Failed .-> ERROR

    ERROR --> RESPONSE

    RESPONSE --> API

    API --> UI

    UI --> USER